    <div class="lp-wrap ctv-two-col">
      <div class="ctv-section-intro"><p class="lp-kicker">01 / The work behind the booking</p><h2 id="ctv-process-heading">From the first call<br>to the follow-up.</h2><p>Before we call, we agree on who to contact and what to say. Then we define what a qualified meeting must include.</p><a class="lp-text-link" href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">Explore our appointment-setting service →</a></div>
      <ol class="ctv-process-list">
        <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Choose who belongs on the list.</h3><p>In this example, we target controllers at distributors with several locations. Single-location businesses are excluded. Bring your existing leads, or ask us to build the list.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Let the conversation guide the follow-up.</h3><p>The caller asks about the buyer’s current process. If the buyer says “call next week,” we record the reason and schedule the callback.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Confirm why a meeting makes sense.</h3><p>We confirm who should attend, what they want to discuss and the agreed next step. Your updates include buyer feedback and changes to the calling plan.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

